Recipe: Beef Caldereta
&#xD;
Ingredients:
&#xD;
&#xD;
1 kg Beef cubed&#xD;
3 cloves Garlic crushed and chopped&#xD;
1 Onion finely chopped&#xD;
4 cups Water&#xD;
1 cup Red Bell Pepper cut into strips&#xD;
1 cup Tomato Sauce&#xD;
1/2 cup Liver Spread or Liver paste processed using blender&#xD;
1 tsp. Crushed Chili&#xD;
3 large Bay Leaves&#xD;
2 cups Potatoes cubed&#xD;
