1 cup water&#xD;
1 cup stewed tomatoes&#xD;
1 clove garlic, minced&#xD;
6 potatoes, peeled and cubed&#xD;
3 onions, chopped&#xD;
6 carrots, chopped&#xD;
1 1/2&#xA0;tablespoons all-purpose flour&#xD;
4 tablespoons water&#xD;
&#xD;
Directions:
&#xD;
&#xD;
